  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Silk Roads Heritage Corridors in Afghanistan, Central Asia and Iran -</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact/overall goal: In the long-term, the action will strengthen the contribution of culture to sustainable development, notably through heritage-based tourism development, diversifying tourism products and delivering high-quality visitor experiences along the Silk Roads heritage corridors in the participating countries. These activities aim to contribute to improving livelihoods of the communities in the region, including youth and women, through capacity-building and the creation of opportunities for income-generation and jobs.</narrative>
  </description>
